Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:25.18,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:30.46,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Can you still stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:33.09,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:37.25,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,You turn your back to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:40.46,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Your head must be empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:44.45,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.76,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:00:59.26,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.82,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You dare take aim at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:09.60,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,How wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:12.34,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,This is an elven village, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:17.30,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,So long as your mist is dealt with, \Nthere is no target they cannot hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:22.63,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Of all the impudent...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.97,0:01:29.11,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.81,0:01:37.48,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Finally here, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:32.98,Ep_Title,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)}Melee
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:44.23,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Hmph! I'll crush these puny \Nhumans before he gets here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.48,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,This mana...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.35,0:03:54.45,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,It seems she has arrived, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:58.35,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,O evil snake that binds my soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:03.58,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Feast on my hatred, imbibe my lamentation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:08.00,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,and turn into a seven-headed \Nharbinger of disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.92,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm really angry right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:15.38,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,How could you hurt the \Nelves and spirits like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:17.98,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Jalaam Dualam!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.36,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Sod off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:26.21,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Your mana will feed my mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:28.27,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:30.62,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,O laws of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:32.82,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Come to me and gather, \Nand erupt into flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:34.84,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:44.23,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:47.97,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,An ugly demonic flower would \Ndo well to know her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:54.96,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Quiet, you stupid rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:03.36,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:05.16,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You did well, Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.77,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:07.85,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:13.19,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Heed my words, O laws of earth and fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.26,0:05:18.21,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Gather thy hellfire and become \Nmy spear of judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:23.04,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Ignite Pilam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:30.62,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Not going to let me take \Nout his friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:34.15,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Celina!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:38.30,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,You cut a pathetic figure, Geolude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:41.89,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,My name is Gellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:46.67,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,I seek to duel you, lamia girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:49.29,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,You are not allowed to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:51.45,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:56.38,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,A new foe. But he's not the one \Nwith the aura from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:09.30,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Gellen! She's my prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:18.93,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celina!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:27.36,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.78,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:35.97,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:40.30,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,That, and the power you displayed before, \Nsuggests you're a superhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:43.43,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Superhuman?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:45.78,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,This is getting interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:48.93,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,You are a worthy opponent to take down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:54.30,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I understand, \Nbut I'm glad you seem to be enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:57.65,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Awaken, El Spada.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:12.77,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Even more amusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:21.79,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,You're surprisingly slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:30.13,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,You wounded me this badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:34.11,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I'll tear you into a million pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:37.94,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Come at me, you scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:45.02,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Halt my target's movements, O earth spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:53.16,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan, let me take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:56.10,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Cursed Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.39,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.41,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:08.41,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Such an energetic little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:12.92,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Jalaam Dualam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:23.57,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,This is quite comforting, if anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:27.39,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,The snakes in the demonic \Nrealm aren't quite so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.39,0:08:28.18,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:30.62,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Try and strangle me to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:37.22,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:43.70,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Are you not prepared to kill despite \Ninheriting the curse of the snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.49,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:55.51,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,A half-hearted girl shouldn't be setting \Nfoot in a battle of life and death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:04.85,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,This is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.95,0:09:09.06,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:29.17,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Such power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:32.84,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,This battle is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:35.41,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:10.14,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,There's the fourth and final one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:15.97,Main,ELF1,0,0,0,,We've taken out most of the demon \Ntroops to the west of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.62,0:10:18.96,Main,ELF2,0,0,0,,That only leaves the leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:20.16,Main,ELF2,0,0,0,,How's it going over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.37,Main,ELF2,0,0,0,,Hey, Gio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:23.83,Main,ELF2,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:27.32,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,What is with that terrifying mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:45.00,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Gellen, I apologize for \Nbutting into your battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:46.25,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,It matters not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:50.99,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,He's clearly a cut above in terms of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:57.85,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Geolude and gang try to torment \Nyou in battle, but not this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:02.41,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,He has a combative aura \Nthat's pointed and refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:05.67,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,He seeks the thrill of \Nbattle above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:12.73,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Not only do you not fear us, \Nbut you also wound us? Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:18.44,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I have not run into a force like \Nthis on the surface in eons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:24.69,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,This will be entertaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:28.44,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Have a taste of this, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:37.96,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Oh? You're swift, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:40.97,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,The name's Dolan! Remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:48.50,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Hm, Dolan? I know of one with that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:51.09,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Not that you would be \Nrelated to him in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:53.61,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Oho?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.71,0:12:01.72,Italics,GEORG,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:07.43,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Did he notice my draconic mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:09.20,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:11.34,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You don't have the time to be taken aback.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.11,0:12:27.94,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.54,0:12:42.07,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:49.48,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,He blocked Explosion by having his shield \Nand three swords take the brunt of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:53.88,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Wow. He has that demon on the back foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:55.50,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:59.12,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Who is that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:03.50,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:08.79,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I am truly surprised that you \Nwould be so capable, Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:11.56,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:15.11,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I thought you were a demon \Nthe same as the other three,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:17.17,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,but you are clearly a cut above.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:20.14,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Former divinity... Are you a fallen god?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:26.19,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I can scarcely believe that a \Nhuman could be that perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:30.16,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I take it you have somewhat of \Na secret identity yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:33.38,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It's not something \NI'm willing to share here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:35.10,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.90,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I can't beat him in my human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:42.92,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But if I use my draconic powers \Nto fight him at full strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:46.04,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,the elven village will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:50.26,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,True, we need not speak with our words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:52.46,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Our swords shall do all the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:55.29,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,What's more, as I possess three blades,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:59.93,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,they can say a lot more \Nthan my tongue ever could!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:15.78,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,A truly splendid opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:25.16,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I didn't step in enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:31.53,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Great power that burns my body and soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.53,0:14:35.94,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Truly am I fortunate! I never expected \Nto find this on the surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.11,0:14:43.19,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Is he building up his mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:49.97,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You can't focus on Georg alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.97,0:14:52.20,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Prepare to die, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:55.05,Main,CHRISTINACELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:15:01.67,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Girlies, you'll have to go through me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:13.42,Main,RAFLASIAGEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:18.03,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm not about to give up my life for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:19.52,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,you demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:35.37,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,He nullified it with wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:39.05,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,He blew away my mist so easily?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.18,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Energy Bolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:53.56,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Pardon their interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:58.27,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,But I trusted that a surprise \Nattack wouldn't take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:10.26,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Surrender to my strength, heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:14.64,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Yield to me, earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:26.89,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Dolan, my inhuman human,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:29.92,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,should you stave off this attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:34.25,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I'll acknowledge you as \Na truly formidable foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:39.55,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Behold one of my ultimate moves, \Nthe Three Demonic Light Blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:52.03,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:01.90,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Will you block it, evade it, or perish?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:26.26,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:38.66,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:44.90,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,You cut down my ultimate move \Nhead-on, albeit on the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:51.46,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,It was worth taking on that stupid \Ncontract and coming up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:57.59,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I hate to rain on your parade,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:18:01.94,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,but I'm not fighting to \Nentertain you, fallen god.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.36,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I've tired of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.23,0:18:09.33,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:12.36,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,You're worried about the women and children?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.39,0:18:19.07,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,You cannot fight me while \Navoiding collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:22.91,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.75,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Hear me, forest dwellers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.37,0:18:32.31,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Will you continue to fight \Nus until you perish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.31,0:18:35.92,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Or will you choose to join \Nour forces and live on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:39.56,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,You are free to choose \Nfrom these two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:46.32,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,We will return to this settlement in \Nthree days' time, army in tow again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:49.60,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Use that time to debate and discuss,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:52.10,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,and decide your future!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:59.02,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Geolude, Gellen, Raflasia, \Nno more for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:02.04,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Hear me, weak lamia girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:06.11,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Know that showing compassion to your \Nfoes is a greater sin than defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:13.64,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I will not forget the humiliation \NI suffered tonight, superhuman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.64,0:19:17.25,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Sadly, my memory is not quite so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:25.85,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:31.78,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I'll torment you until you come begging \Nto be put out of your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:35.36,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,No, I'll be avenging my friends and family,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.36,0:19:38.52,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,you filthy demonic flower spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.23,0:19:41.90,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Three days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:45.94,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,We will show no mercy to anyone then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:48.46,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:51.96,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I promise I'll show you my \Nfull capabilities then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.81,0:20:08.94,Italics,GEORG,0,0,0,,I never expected to fight him personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:11.61,Italics,GEORG,0,0,0,,Fate is a cruel mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.57,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.57,0:20:21.17,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:26.63,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,That smile you gave me had \Nme fearing the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:29.37,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:32.56,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Nary a scratch on me, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:35.83,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Are you two unhurt, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:38.86,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:43.47,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I'm all right, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:46.22,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,There is a lot I wish to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:48.06,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Should I save it for later?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:50.92,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I would appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.30,0:20:56.03,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Besides, it looks like Gio and the \Nelves wish to speak with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:04.73,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Not the warmest of welcomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:08.08,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It is what it is. We came at a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:11.50,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,We'll have to gain their \Nrespect with our actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.93,0:21:19.51,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Pardon us, Tribal Chief Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.27,0:21:28.26,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:31.05,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,I've received word of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.05,0:21:33.98,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Gio, are they the ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.72,0:21:35.45,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:38.90,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,I heard you're from Verun Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:41.80,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,I must thank you for helping Merl, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:44.53,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,I'm Dio the elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:51.27,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,This is Vlaic the wolfman and \NAlsienne the arachne.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.65,0:21:52.91,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:58.21,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,They must be the chiefs of the \Nvarious tribes residing in this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.79,0:22:02.47,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,I've heard that you possess power \Nsurpassing that of the average human.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.47,0:22:08.54,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Then we must ask for the viewpoint of \None living in a human town, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:17.73,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Headmistress Olivia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:21.80,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,It's been too long, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.95,0:23:59.96,Next_Episode,SIGN,0,0,0,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.79,0:24:07.81,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,This week's lucky item is El Spada!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:09.70,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Look forward to next time!
